3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sahuagin_Champion\" title=\"Sahuagin Champion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Sahuagin_Champion.png/25px-Portrait_Sahuagin_Champion.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Sahuagin_Champion.png/38px-Portrait_Sahuagin_Champion.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Sahuagin_Champion.png/50px-Portrait_Sahuagin_Champion.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sahuagin Champion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Sahuagin_Champion.png/25px-Portrait_Sahuagin_Champion.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Portrait_Sahuagin_Champion.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sahuagin_Champion\" title=\"Sahuagin Champion\">Sahuagin Champion</a> who jumps out of the water in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a>, by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/20px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/30px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/40px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heapside Strand\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/20px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Heapside Strand, in his inventory at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;62&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-149</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>If you're reading this, I'm probably dead. Trapped underwater by madmen and fishfucks. Explosives everywhere, no way out. Praying for help. Margery, Quinten, Holly - I love you all.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Presumably penned by a prisoner on the <a href=\"/wiki/Iron_Throne\" title=\"Iron Throne\">Iron Throne</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034542\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1960/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28771/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7363/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936144/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.763      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   47.763      1 -total\n 43.11%   20.589      7 Template:Icon_text\n 39.67%   18.949     23 Template:Trim\n 19.78%    9.449      2 Template:Uid\n 13.25%    6.331      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.25%    6.328      1 Template:RarityItem\n 12.10%    5.778      1 Template:Item_icon\n 11.33%    5.411      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.92%    5.216      2 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:32621-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715034542 and revision id 366711. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}